  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Ultimate Steak Sandwich",
  "description": "In this non-traditional steak sandwich, the steak is cut into thick strips, so we&#39;re able to get a nice sear on the outside without having to worry about the inside overcooking.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
